    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6194" root="جلو" body-key="j">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجتلاهُ</span></b>  <i>He looked at him,</i> or <i>it.</i> (K.) [See
also 5.] Hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجتلى العَرُوسَ</span>, explained above:
see 1. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 1 in two other places,
last two sentences. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِجْتَلَيْتُ العِمَامَةَ عَنْ رَأْسِى</span>
<i>I raised the turban, while folding it, from the
side of my forehead</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْ جَبِينِى</span>): (S:) [like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلَهْتُهَا</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجتلى</span> <i>It became polished,</i> or <i>furbished;</i> said of a sword [&amp;c.]. (TA.)

